    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010WallpaperPlay\u3011 It is a powerful desktop beautification tool that integrates dynamic wallpapers, desktop clocks, music spectrums, typing following features, and mouse pointers. For desktop beautification, this one is all you need! O(\u2229_\u2229)O~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Wallpapers: It supports using videos as wallpapers, saying goodbye to static desktops. The Creative Workshop is rich in resources, providing a large number of videos for download, which are constantly updated. Users can also upload wallpapers by themselves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/cfc90d794bf6da98fd94192f30c58fc6.poster.avif?t=1747163691\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/cfc90d794bf6da98fd94192f30c58fc6.webm?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/cfc90d794bf6da98fd94192f30c58fc6.mp4?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive Wallpapers: The wallpapers can interact with the mouse. When the mouse moves or clicks, the elements of the wallpaper will give corresponding feedback, making the wallpaper more interesting and interactive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/fdd372b0c73d091d4010b9cb969c077d.poster.avif?t=1747163691\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/fdd372b0c73d091d4010b9cb969c077d.webm?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/fdd372b0c73d091d4010b9cb969c077d.mp4?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desktop Clock: The clock is displayed on the desktop with various styles. You can choose both a simple digital clock and a retro pointer clock. While it is convenient to check the time, it also adds a practical decoration to the desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/75766d93c68e8cd795495cebc1154088.poster.avif?t=1747163691\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/75766d93c68e8cd795495cebc1154088.webm?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/75766d93c68e8cd795495cebc1154088.mp4?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music Spectrum: There are multiple spectrum styles that can follow the system sound in real time, visualizing the sound and presenting it on the desktop. As the music plays, the spectrum will beat and change according to the rhythm, creating a dynamic desktop atmosphere for music lovers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/1bc29a14f37f9ce851980c0a8fc4d2e3.poster.avif?t=1747163691\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/1bc29a14f37f9ce851980c0a8fc4d2e3.webm?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/1bc29a14f37f9ce851980c0a8fc4d2e3.mp4?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse Pointers: It provides more than 300 mouse pointer styles for replacement, ranging from cute and lovely styles to cool and technological styles, meeting different aesthetic needs and making mouse operations more personalized.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/8481f66adbbc02009c2147c766e35274.poster.avif?t=1747163691\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/8481f66adbbc02009c2147c766e35274.webm?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/8481f66adbbc02009c2147c766e35274.mp4?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Typing Following: The cute pet typing function is full of fun. When users tap the keyboard, the cute pet on the screen will tap the same keys synchronously, as if there is a little partner accompanying you while typing, adding fun to daily typing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/ef740370619000af4fcd32b1e57b5016.poster.avif?t=1747163691\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/ef740370619000af4fcd32b1e57b5016.webm?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/ef740370619000af4fcd32b1e57b5016.mp4?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/b10b4cced9af8154dc8bee6f2b11ca11.poster.avif?t=1747163691\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/b10b4cced9af8154dc8bee6f2b11ca11.webm?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/b10b4cced9af8154dc8bee6f2b11ca11.mp4?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjusting Volume via the Taskbar: Slide the mouse wheel on the taskbar to adjust the volume.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/d230b348fec4e63d5072e0e0d7ddbd95.poster.avif?t=1747163691\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/d230b348fec4e63d5072e0e0d7ddbd95.webm?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/d230b348fec4e63d5072e0e0d7ddbd95.mp4?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double-click the Taskbar to Hide Desktop Icons: Double-click the taskbar to hide/show desktop icons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/e8d16509eadf68bf8ea533edf4cd1567.poster.avif?t=1747163691\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/e8d16509eadf68bf8ea533edf4cd1567.webm?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/e8d16509eadf68bf8ea533edf4cd1567.mp4?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desktop To-do List: The desktop to-do list component can quickly organize your life/work items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/171a07aa2aeef97f7c1e9ccd4526b691.poster.avif?t=1747163691\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/171a07aa2aeef97f7c1e9ccd4526b691.webm?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/171a07aa2aeef97f7c1e9ccd4526b691.mp4?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010WallpaperPlay\u3011 It is a powerful desktop beautification tool that integrates dynamic wallpapers, desktop clocks, music spectrums, typing following features, and mouse pointers. For desktop beautification, this one is all you need! O(\u2229_\u2229)O~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Wallpapers: It supports using videos as wallpapers, saying goodbye to static desktops. The Creative Workshop is rich in resources, providing a large number of videos for download, which are constantly updated. Users can also upload wallpapers by themselves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/cfc90d794bf6da98fd94192f30c58fc6.poster.avif?t=1747163691\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/cfc90d794bf6da98fd94192f30c58fc6.webm?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/cfc90d794bf6da98fd94192f30c58fc6.mp4?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive Wallpapers: The wallpapers can interact with the mouse. When the mouse moves or clicks, the elements of the wallpaper will give corresponding feedback, making the wallpaper more interesting and interactive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/fdd372b0c73d091d4010b9cb969c077d.poster.avif?t=1747163691\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/fdd372b0c73d091d4010b9cb969c077d.webm?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/fdd372b0c73d091d4010b9cb969c077d.mp4?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desktop Clock: The clock is displayed on the desktop with various styles. You can choose both a simple digital clock and a retro pointer clock. While it is convenient to check the time, it also adds a practical decoration to the desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/75766d93c68e8cd795495cebc1154088.poster.avif?t=1747163691\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/75766d93c68e8cd795495cebc1154088.webm?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/75766d93c68e8cd795495cebc1154088.mp4?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music Spectrum: There are multiple spectrum styles that can follow the system sound in real time, visualizing the sound and presenting it on the desktop. As the music plays, the spectrum will beat and change according to the rhythm, creating a dynamic desktop atmosphere for music lovers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/1bc29a14f37f9ce851980c0a8fc4d2e3.poster.avif?t=1747163691\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/1bc29a14f37f9ce851980c0a8fc4d2e3.webm?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"htt