amai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/e8d16509eadf68bf8ea533edf4cd1567.webm?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/e8d16509eadf68bf8ea533edf4cd1567.mp4?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desktop To-do List: The desktop to-do list component can quickly organize your life/work items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/171a07aa2aeef97f7c1e9ccd4526b691.poster.avif?t=1747163691\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/171a07aa2aeef97f7c1e9ccd4526b691.webm?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413340/extras/171a07aa2aeef97f7c1e9ccd4526b691.mp4?t=1747163691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
